  "prompt": "Xác định tập hợp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trong mỗi trường hợp sau:\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"infix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"infix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"infix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"infix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là tập hợp các hình thoi, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là tập hợp các hình chữ nhật.</li></ol>",
