  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xét hệ phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là tập hợp các hình vuông.</li></ol>",
